"smart_blocks:Computer Science/Core Concepts/select().md#FFB86CA6;\">It blocks until at least one file descriptor becomes ready or a timeout occurs</mark>. The function uses fd_set structures to track which file descriptors to monitor and returns information about which ones are ready. This allows programs to handle multiple connections or input sources efficiently without creating separate threads for each.": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.08298703,-0.05977285,0.01262687,-0.05828633,-0.00137951,0.00353065,0.01750629,0.02043964,0.09693524,-0.01930151,-0.00141188,0.02952002,0.01020166,0.01908428,-0.03355041,0.02298271,-0.03701048,0.01201554,0.0352402,-0.07342983,0.06759636,-0.01696222,-0.05636484,-0.10189371,-0.00899995,0.06798424,-0.00019693,-0.03600555,-0.0481482,-0.17800598,0.01836806,-0.00883401,0.02010251,-0.00986655,-0.02476715,-0.05134725,0.01880462,0.05078249,-0.0262344,-0.00928422,0.0015365,0.04350518,-0.03580153,-0.04947898,-0.05232981,-0.02643855,-0.05549061,-0.06782762,0.0053871,-0.01282505,0.02289801,-0.0392257,0.06332148,-0.03951321,0.00250254,0.04804477,0.02469379,0.02648048,0.01941475,0.02547173,0.0020479,0.02044743,-0.14909051,0.07705566,0.05572108,0.0266672,-0.03858179,-0.04555815,0.04006669,0.06642485,-0.03364273,0.02133184,-0.00297456,0.04881078,0.03749659,-0.09882256,-0.02863304,0.00585272,-0.02710899,0.01125621,-0.0582446,-0.01633256,-0.03391618,-0.02394601,-0.06214405,0.02110117,0.00710501,-0.02664893,0.01539184,0.01925518,-0.03610969,-0.04013018,0.03434593,0.05369095,-0.03619983,-0.01466016,0.02741501,0.01518642,-0.00340508,0.11489796,-0.07002603,0.00616419,-0.02967311,-0.0020265,0.01103381,-0.04214469,-0.00434737,0.01754968,-0.06571933,-0.04201415,0.03239614,-0.04430449,0.05845552,-0.04574567,0.04533977,0.02246326,0.03146126,-0.00081958,0.00682542,0.03763188,0.02307751,0.03241164,0.03896809,-0.00728719,0.06279479,-0.05136335,0.04875434,0.06540537,0.0131324,-0.0018807,0.05771324,0.00986918,-0.0373876,0.02243571,0